On July 9th and 10th, 2016, the co-sponsored Indie game festival "'''BitSummit'''" was held in Kyoto's Event Hall "[[wikipedia:ja:京都市勧業館|Miyako Messe]]". To commemorate, a time-limited Special Stage called 協賛BitSummit記念！ appeared in [[Legend Stages]]. Completing the stage would grant a [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Cat Ticket]]. The event has returned every year since then until 2020 when the festival was cancelled and replaced to be online.

